n order to tackle the two unique challenges of VTT, i.e. cognitive challenge and descriptive challenge, we propose three specific strategies to enhance the above TTNet, including difference sensitive encoding, masked transformation model, and auxiliary learning. To distinguish more clearly, we called the model that does not use these three strategies TTNetbase."
